    "text": "Many companies get comfortable doing what they have always done, making only incremental changes. This incrementalism leads to irrelevance over time, especially in technology, where change tends to be revolutionary, not evolutionary.\n\nOur early investments in AI started out as moonshots but are now incorporated into our core products and central to future developments. In Other Bets, our fully autonomous driving technology company, Waymo, is now providing fully autonomous, paid ride-hailing services to customers in multiple cities. Isomorphic Labs is reimagining the drug discovery process from first principles, applying AI to accelerate the development of new medicines. We continue to look toward the future and to invest for the long term, most notably for the application of AI to our products and services, as well as other frontier technologies such as quantum computing.",
    "metadata": {
      "company": "alphabet",
      "year": "2025",
      "item": "Item 1 - BUSINESS",
      "source": "C:\\Users\\Administrator\\Documents\\Capstone\\capstone_agent_desk\\data\\filings\\alphabet\\2025\\goog-20251231.htm",
