    },
    "passage_id": "P1"
  },
  {
    "text": "Across Alphabet, we are also using technology to try to solve big problems that affect a wide variety of industries, including transportation and health technology. Alphabet’s investment in the portfolio of Other Bets includes businesses that are at various stages of development, ranging from those in the research and development phase, such as X, our moonshot factory focused on developing breakthrough technologies, to those that are scaling commercialization, such as Waymo, which is expanding to more cities domestically, entering international markets, and further scaling operations.",
    "metadata": {
      "company": "alphabet",
      "year": "2025",
      "item": "Item 1 - BUSINESS",
